      "text": "shop. The old barn was replaced for a holiday cottages, and relocated close to\nthe chickens, near the river.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        136.5320587158203,
        511.2696838378906,
        215.03359985351562
      ],
      "text": "Lot of things have changed since 1950, and Beechwood Farm is not an\nexception. Modern times had come, and everyone had to be adjusted to new\nways of living. We still have Beechwood Farm, but a new sophisticated and\nmodern one.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        259.89202880859375,
        264.1419372558594,
        279.3934326171875
      ],
      "text": "Here is the examiner's comment:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        291.87469482421875,
        516.5330200195312,
        390.2336120605469
      ],
      "text": "This response addresses all of the changes illustrated in the farm plans. The\nwriter describes how the farm looked in 1950, then moves on to the present-\nday plan. There is an overview in the last paragraph [Lot of things have\nchanged since 1950, and Beechwood Farm … a new sophisticated and modern\none] but it does not mention the link to attracting visitors, so is not complete.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        403.23468017578125,
        506.727783203125,
        481.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "Information is generally arranged coherently. The first two paragraphs cover\nthe 1950s site, with the remainder focused on the farm today. There is\nevidence of linking expressions [At the opposite side | That | Nowadays];\nhowever, there is a lack of reference, resulting in repetition [farm | zone].\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        494.6746826171875,
        522.4630126953125,
        553.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Vocabulary is generally good [parking zone | relocated | exception | adjusted |\nsophisticated] but errors remain [along the time / over time | tipycal |\nsourrounded | Nowadays | easyer | cottages].\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        566.314697265625,
        519.4422607421875,
        684.4736328125
      ],
      "text": "Grammatical range is mixed. There are examples of complex sentence forms,\nincluding [If] clauses and modal forms [could reach | can also find] but there\nare also a range of errors which preclude a higher score. To improve the score,\nan overview that summarises the main changes should be added. It would also\nbe beneficial to show greater accuracy in vocabulary and use of grammatical\nstructures.\n"
    },
